        1185,
        534
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is a policy of the City that existing housing stock and residential neighbor-hoods be maintained and, where necessary, rehabilitated to provide decent, safe and sanitary housing; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
